    "why": "THE TWO MODES ON ONE WORLD, ANSWERING DIFFERENT QUESTIONS. The figures are exactly those of the external case: p-ali one night, p-noor five, an expected share of three each. Deviation mode names both people, once each; spread mode measures only the distance between the busiest and the quietest and produces ONE finding naming the pair. The allowance is the widest gap deviation mode would have permitted between those two — each person's own tolerance, added — so a schedule clean under deviation is clean under spread, and the two modes of one rule cannot contradict each other on the same draft.",
